            ns3:date "2023-06-30"^^xsd:date ;
            ns2:text "[Official] The National Archives of Australia will be decommissioning the AGLS Metadata Standard website at the end of 2023. More information can be found at https://www.naa.gov.au/information-management/standards/agls-metadata-standard. An archived copy of the AGLS website will continue to be available via The National Library of Australia’s Trove facility: https://webarchive.nla.gov.au/awa/20230304113201/https://agls.gov.au/" ],
        [ a ns2:Review ;
