            ns3:date "2020-04-16"^^xsd:date ;
            ns2:text "The Timebank Ontology is used to describe Timebank systems for Peer-to-Peer Service Exchange. A Timebank allows user to store virtual money, often called a Time Dollar, into a bank account [Cahn2004]. This virtual currency can be earned by helping fellow Timebank users and spent by requesting help from others." ] ;
