            ns3:creator <http://data.semanticweb.org/person/bernard-vatant> ;
            ns3:date "2013-07-01"^^xsd:date ;
            ns2:text "Unfortunately this vocabulary reinvents a lot of elements of e.g., Dublin Core such as \"subject\", \"contributor\" , \"replaces\" etc. Included here because it is used by various Nature Publishing Group linked datasets, but it does not meet the reusing good practices expected in LOV." ] ;
