            ns2:text "Found some information (including a title : \"Logic\") on the \"Semantic Web Application Platform\" project page. (note that this project used other ontologies too, listed at http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/doc/CwmBuiltins). Advice : don't try to reuse unless you are a (semantic) web historian." ],
