            ns3:date "2014-03-14"^^xsd:date ;
            ns2:text "A deliverable of the W3C Semantic Sensor Network Incubator Group, started on 4 March 2009 and closed on 28 June 2011. Should be stable. Imports three other vocabularies from the same source [to be further added to LOV]." ] ;
