<https://w3id.org/dingo/> a ns1:Vocabulary ;
    dcterms:contributor <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1775-9921>,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4624-568X>,
        <https://www.dublincore.org/about/executive/>,
