            ns2:text "Metadata are extracted from the human parsing and interpretation of <doc:version>$Id: ont.rdf,v 1.7 2009/04/20 10:12:30 timbl Exp $</doc:version>. The W3C does not show a good practice here, this should be replaced by proper dcterms:creator and dcterms:date declarations." ] ;
