            ns3:creator <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1562-6922> ;
            ns3:date "2016-08-19"^^xsd:date ;
            ns2:text "It is the default vocabulary in the clinical world for Unified Code for Units of Measure\\n(UCUM). According to Eric (W3C), \"It\\nhas some specialized stuff like \"in Hg\". Also had \"light-year\", which\\neither makes it a general-purpose units ontology, or light-years\\nfactor more into clinical practice than I expected.\"" ] ;
