<http://dati.beniculturali.it/cultural-ON/cultural-ON.owl> a ns1:Vocabulary ;
    dcterms:creator <http://data.semanticweb.org/person/aldo-gangemi>,
        <http://data.semanticweb.org/person/valentina-presutti>,
